  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073844/description_6b8a41fe-cc96-49cc-a6a5-b997aa416331.png\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"> <span style=\"color:#18e612\">進階綠寶石</span> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073844/description_6b8a41fe-cc96-49cc-a6a5-b997aa416331.png\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"></h1><p>進階綠寶石是一個模組，讓你能製作完整的綠寶石裝備，包括帕克塞爾鎬、錘子及挖掘機。綠寶石套裝的強度介於鐵與鑽石之間，是兩者之間的中間過渡階段。</p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#a74cdc\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073844/description_4bd6b840-c1da-4753-8729-e1f9d7948b4b.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> <span style=\"color:#68fd64\">綠寶石盔甲、工具及武器數值：</span></span></h2><table style=\"width:99.8747%;border:1px solid rgb(15, 155, 11);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\">\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ef3b3b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073844/description_2ac8826e-f24a-42a9-86c3-cb6fb5c9d46b.gif\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\"> <span style=\"color:#28ba2c\">盔甲</span></span></strong></h3>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\"><strong>頭盔</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\"><strong>胸甲</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:15.7993%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\"><strong>護腿</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5948%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\"><strong>靴子</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 盔甲值</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\"><strong>+2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\"><strong>+7</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:15.7993%;border-color:rgb(15, 155, 11);border-width:1px\"><st